DESCRIPTION:In America\, the government doesn’t get to grab people off t
 he streets\, skip the courtroom\, and send them straight to a foreign pris
 on. Disappeared in America is a Yolo County day of action to stand up for 
 the rule of law and confront the Trump administration’s illegal abductio
 ns\, detentions\, and deportations of people like Kilmar Abrego Garcia\, R
 ui Marras\, and Juan Maldonado Zuniga. 🚨 On the 1st Wednesday of the mo
 nth\, we’re showing up in Woodland in front of the new courthouse at 100
 0 Main St. 
LOCATION:In front of the new courthouse\, 1000 Main St\, Woodland\, CA\, 9
 5695
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisibleyolo/event/877695/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
